					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Quellious: A Brief History</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Aeriss</b> on <b>March 30, 2005, 09:47:28 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I would like to welcome all to the new family we call Quellious, even though we have a few quirks and a few idiots, the Quell family has always been pretty much a nice place to hang out.  We are looking forward to meeting you all and welcoming you into the server we call home.  I am sure we can add a few more rooms for you all to tuck yourselves into at night.<br /><br />Welcome to your future new home. <br /></div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Quellious: A Brief History</b><br />
					Post by: <b>xaanru</b> on <b>March 30, 2005, 10:09:25 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Even though the quellious name will be used, this is a MERGER, not a mass character transfer. <br /><br />We are not moving to quellious. The old quellious and rodcet servers are being combined, to form something new, that just happens to also be called quellious.</div>
					<br />
